truenas-proxmox-plugin (2.1.23~alpha25) unstable; urgency=medium

  * NVMe: enable reconnect-driven recovery from path().

    Alpha24 added the i==125 last-resort reconnect. It never fired in
    the follow-up run. Investigation showed sub path() (line 5003) —
    which every PVE VM op goes through: qmclone, qmstart, qmdestroy —
    was calling _nvme_device_for_uuid WITHOUT allow_reconnect=>1.
