    saw "Failed to create iSCSI extent for clone: " with an empty tail
    (see test_run4/truenas-2026-07-13/run-01 template/linked-clone
    failures). Capture the create error into a lexical before the
    cleanup so the die carries the underlying diagnostic (e.g. the
    duplicate-extent-name or EBUSY that actually caused the failure).

